    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood for Nobody Else is a short story and physics-based challenge to split logs in two.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're underpaid, overworked, and what you can do is never enough.<br><br>Your task is simple: make it through the week. The bills have to be paid somehow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-based gameplay aiming and controlling your trusty axe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each log splits where you strike the wood  - keep it clean and do your best!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring based on your ability to chop accurately and be a good worker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original short story and dialog for seven in-game days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient, lo-fi soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existential dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
